<p>
A simple prayer for the new year:
</p>

<p>
God of grace and wisdom<br>
create in me a new desire,<br>
that I may be no more, and no less,<br>
than who you created me to be.<br>
</p>

<p>
For that, dear Lord, is surely enough.<br>
</p>

<p>
<i>Amen</i>
</p>


